        "start": 116.232,
        "end": 117.507,
        "text": "不管你是变现还是接广告",
        "representativeTime": 116.87,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-043.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-007"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-044",
        "start": 117.507,
        "end": 120.64,
        "text": "比如说vlog呀，植入空间多的视频啊，或者说好物分享啊",
        "representativeTime": 119.073,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-044.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-007"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-045",
        "start": 120.65,
        "end": 121.821,
        "text": "第四个目的呢就是调性",
        "representativeTime": 121.236,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-045.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-007"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-046",
        "start": 121.821,
        "end": 124.164,
        "text": "你会发现今天有越来越多的网红去做视频博客",
        "representativeTime": 122.993,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-046.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-007",
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-047",
        "start": 124.164,
        "end": 126.272,
        "text": "凭一条几十分钟的短视频制作成本非常高",
        "representativeTime": 125.218,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-047.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-048",
        "start": 126.272,
        "end": 129.32,
        "text": "但是数据可能也没那么好的目的呢，就是提高你的账号调性",
        "representativeTime": 127.796,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-048.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-049",
        "start": 129.33,
        "end": 130.842,
        "text": "同样能提高这样调性的视频呢",
        "representativeTime": 130.086,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-049.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-050",
        "start": 130.842,
        "end": 132.354,
        "text": "还有时尚类视频展现你的审美",
        "representativeTime": 131.598,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-050.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-051",
        "start": 132.354,
        "end": 133.866,
        "text": "还有短片的第五个目的是表达",
        "representativeTime": 133.11,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-051.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-052",
        "start": 133.866,
        "end": 135.61,
        "text": "如果你想做自媒体没有表达欲的话",
        "representativeTime": 134.738,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-052.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-053",
        "start": 135.61,
        "end": 139.1,
        "text": "你是不适合做博主，那么今天就说到这里，我是人类智商变大，我们",
        "representativeTime": 137.355,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-053.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-008",
          "SHOT-009"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-054",
        "start": 139.11,
        "end": 139.923,
        "text": "下期再见",
        "representativeTime": 139.517,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-054.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-009"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
